                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Plum Beauty's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Values-based positioning (vegan + cruelty-free + eco-conscious) + operational substantiation + premium quality + retail + international expansion.</p>
                                        <h3>Are values-based brands sustainable long-term?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes with genuine operational commitment + substantiation. Values-based positioning increasingly important for younger + urban + international consumers.</p>
                                        <h3>Can other values-based brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>Yes in specific values-niching (organic + sustainable + regional + specific-concern). Values-based positioning continues expanding.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest values-based brand lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Substantiation + operational commitment + certification + ongoing storytelling essential. Not superficial marketing.</p>
